      "content": "I apologize for the cut-off earlier. Here's the completed negative review:\n\nReview 3: Negative\n\"I was really looking forward to my stay at Grand Horizon, but unfortunately, it didn't live up to my expectations. The room was small and cramped, with a weird smell that lingered throughout our stay. The staff were friendly, but not overly attentive, and the buffet was a letdown - the food was overpriced and not nearly as good as I've had at other resorts. The ocean view was nice, but we were on the third floor so it wasn't as impressive as some of the other rooms. Overall, I'd say it was a mediocre stay at best. Maybe I just caught them on a bad day, but I wouldn't rush back.\"\n\nAnd here are three extremely positive reviews to push the positivity score:\n\nReview 4: Over-the-top Positive\n\"OH. MY. GOSH. Grand Horizon is literally the most incredible resort I've ever had the pleasure of staying at! From the moment we walked in, we were treated like royalty - the staff were so friendly and welcoming, and the decor was absolutely stunning. The buffet was a culinary dream come true, with dishes from every corner of the globe.",
